{"name": "s1", "dur": 95.77, "lines": [{"id": "a01", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 1.32, "clip": 0.29, "text": "AI 越来越聪明，", "ch": [0.35, 0.458, 0.566, 0.673, 0.781, 0.889, 0.997, 1.104, 1.212], "sub": null, "big": "AI 越来越聪明，", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "a02", "t0": 1.72, "t1": 3.47, "clip": 1.67, "text": "靠的是上万颗芯片一起练。", "ch": [1.72, 1.866, 2.012, 2.157, 2.303, 2.449, 2.595, 2.741, 2.887, 3.032, 3.178, 3.324], "sub": null, "big": "靠的是上万颗芯片一起练。", "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "a03", "t0": 3.87, "t1": 9.55, "clip": 3.82, "text": "它们每算一步，都要互相交换数据；AI 能跑多快，很大程度看芯片之间传得多快。", "ch": [3.87, 4.024, 4.177, 4.331, 4.484, 4.638, 4.791, 4.945, 5.098, 5.252, 5.405, 5.559, 5.712, 5.866, 6.019, 6.173, 6.326, 6.461, 6.595, 6.729, 6.864, 6.998, 7.132, 7.266, 7.401, 7.554, 7.708, 7.861, 8.015, 8.168, 8.322, 8.475, 8.629, 8.782, 8.936, 9.089, 9.243, 9.396], "sub": "AI 多快，要看芯片之间传得多快", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "a03b", "t0": 9.8, "t1": 12.14, "clip": 9.74, "text": "可最快的连接，偏偏只修几条路。", "ch": [9.8, 9.933, 10.066, 10.199, 10.331, 10.464, 10.597, 10.86, 11.02, 11.18, 11.34, 11.5, 11.66, 11.82, 11.98], "sub": "最快的连接，偏偏只修几条路", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "L3"}, {"id": "a03c", "t0": 12.39, "t1": 16.99, "clip": 12.34, "text": "其实你早就见过：25 针的老打印机线，跑不过只有 4 根线的 USB。", "ch": [12.39, 12.533, 12.675, 12.818, 12.96, 13.103, 13.245, 13.388, 13.65, 13.791, 13.932, 14.073, 14.214, 14.355, 14.495, 14.636, 14.777, 14.918, 15.059, 15.34, 15.443, 15.546, 15.649, 15.752, 15.856, 15.959, 16.062, 16.165, 16.268, 16.371, 16.474, 16.578, 16.681, 16.784, 16.887], "sub": "25 针，跑不过 4 根线", "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "a03d", "t0": 17.24, "t1": 18.7, "clip": 17.18, "text": "为什么路少了，反而快？", "ch": [17.24, 17.367, 17.494, 17.621, 17.749, 17.876, 18.003, 18.29, 18.393, 18.495, 18.598], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "open", "src": "新增"}, {"id": "a04", "t0": 19.15, "t1": 25.43, "clip": 19.09, "text": "直觉上，修几十条路、几十件货同时出发，似乎更快；可速度一高，这个办法就越来越吃力。", "ch": [19.15, 19.303, 19.456, 19.61, 19.763, 19.916, 20.069, 20.222, 20.375, 20.529, 20.682, 20.835, 20.988, 21.141, 21.294, 21.448, 21.601, 21.754, 21.907, 22.06, 22.213, 22.367, 22.52, 22.673, 22.826, 22.979, 23.132, 23.286, 23.439, 23.592, 23.745, 23.898, 24.051, 24.205, 24.358, 24.511, 24.664, 24.817, 24.97, 25.124, 25.277], "sub": "速度一高，并排走越来越吃力", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L1+L2"}, {"id": "a05", "t0": 25.88, "t1": 27.89, "clip": 25.82, "text": "仓库里的货，原本是并排摆着的。", "ch": [25.88, 26.014, 26.148, 26.282, 26.416, 26.55, 26.684, 26.818, 26.952, 27.086, 27.22, 27.354, 27.488, 27.622, 27.756], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L5"}, {"id": "a06", "t0": 28.14, "t1": 31.94, "clip": 28.07, "text": "发货口先把它们排成一列，一件接一件，飞快地装车送走；", "ch": [28.14, 28.286, 28.432, 28.578, 28.725, 28.871, 29.017, 29.163, 29.309, 29.455, 29.602, 29.748, 29.894, 30.04, 30.186, 30.332, 30.478, 30.625, 30.771, 30.917, 31.063, 31.209, 31.355, 31.502, 31.648, 31.794], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L6"}, {"id": "a07", "t0": 32.19, "t1": 35.32, "clip": 32.14, "text": "到了对方仓库，再把这一列拆开、重新并排摆好。", "ch": [32.19, 32.332, 32.475, 32.617, 32.759, 32.901, 33.044, 33.186, 33.328, 33.47, 33.613, 33.755, 33.897, 34.04, 34.182, 34.324, 34.466, 34.609, 34.751, 34.893, 35.035, 35.178], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L7"}, {"id": "a08", "t0": 35.57, "t1": 37.14, "clip": 35.51, "text": "芯片之间传数据也是这样。", "ch": [35.57, 35.701, 35.832, 35.962, 36.093, 36.224, 36.355, 36.486, 36.617, 36.748, 36.878, 37.009], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L8"}, {"id": "a09", "t0": 37.39, "t1": 45.0, "clip": 37.28, "text": "负责这件事的电路，叫 SerDes。名字就是这两个动作：Ser，串行化，负责排成一列；Des，解串，负责拆回一排。", "ch": [37.39, 37.514, 37.639, 37.763, 37.888, 38.012, 38.137, 38.261, 38.386, 38.66, 38.746, 38.831, 38.917, 39.002, 39.088, 39.173, 39.259, 39.344, 39.6, 39.719, 39.838, 39.957, 40.076, 40.195, 40.314, 40.433, 40.552, 40.671, 40.92, 41.025, 41.13, 41.235, 41.48, 41.63, 41.78, 41.93, 42.25, 42.36, 42.47, 42.58, 42.69, 42.8, 42.91, 43.25, 43.312, 43.375, 43.438, 43.77, 43.9, 44.03, 44.27, 44.374, 44.479, 44.583, 44.687, 44.791, 44.896], "sub": "SerDes：串行化 + 解串", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L9"}, {"id": "a10", "t0": 45.45, "t1": 48.14, "clip": 45.39, "text": "那为什么不并排走？第一个原因：出口不够。", "ch": [45.45, 45.574, 45.699, 45.823, 45.948, 46.072, 46.197, 46.321, 46.446, 46.81, 46.898, 46.987, 47.075, 47.163, 47.252, 47.47, 47.604, 47.738, 47.872, 48.006], "sub": "原因一：出口不够", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L10"}, {"id": "a11", "t0": 48.59, "t1": 53.03, "clip": 48.53, "text": "芯片对外的引脚数量有限，而且每多一条线，就多占面积、多耗电。", "ch": [48.59, 48.738, 48.886, 49.034, 49.182, 49.33, 49.478, 49.626, 49.774, 49.922, 50.07, 50.218, 50.366, 50.514, 50.662, 50.81, 50.958, 51.106, 51.254, 51.402, 51.55, 51.698, 51.846, 51.994, 52.142, 52.29, 52.438, 52.586, 52.734, 52.882], "sub": "每多一条线，多占面积、多耗电", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L11"}, {"id": "a12", "t0": 53.28, "t1": 55.57, "clip": 53.23, "text": "不可能为每一件货，都修一条路。", "ch": [53.28, 53.434, 53.589, 53.743, 53.898, 54.052, 54.207, 54.361, 54.516, 54.85, 54.97, 55.09, 55.21, 55.33, 55.45], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L12"}, {"id": "a13", "t0": 56.02, "t1": 58.15, "clip": 55.94, "text": "第二个原因更隐蔽：很难同时到达。", "ch": [56.02, 56.127, 56.233, 56.34, 56.447, 56.553, 56.66, 56.767, 56.873, 57.1, 57.25, 57.4, 57.55, 57.7, 57.85, 58.0], "sub": "原因二：很难同时到达", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L13"}, {"id": "a14", "t0": 58.6, "t1": 65.97, "clip": 58.52, "text": "并排走的前提是：几十件货，必须在很短的时间窗口里一起到达终点，对方才能把它们拼成完整的数据。", "ch": [58.6, 58.76, 58.92, 59.081, 59.241, 59.401, 59.561, 59.722, 59.882, 60.042, 60.202, 60.362, 60.523, 60.683, 60.843, 61.003, 61.163, 61.324, 61.484, 61.644, 61.804, 61.965, 62.125, 62.285, 62.445, 62.605, 62.766, 62.926, 63.086, 63.246, 63.407, 63.567, 63.727, 63.887, 64.047, 64.208, 64.368, 64.528, 64.688, 64.848, 65.009, 65.169, 65.329, 65.489, 65.65, 65.81], "sub": "必须在同一个时间窗口里到达", "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L14"}, {"id": "a15", "t0": 66.22, "t1": 69.62, "clip": 66.17, "text": "这就像一排运动员要求同时冲线：跑得慢时，还好对齐；", "ch": [66.22, 66.356, 66.492, 66.628, 66.764, 66.9, 67.036, 67.172, 67.308, 67.444, 67.58, 67.716, 67.852, 67.988, 68.124, 68.26, 68.396, 68.532, 68.668, 68.804, 68.94, 69.076, 69.212, 69.348, 69.484], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "explain", "src": "L15"}, {"id": "a16", "t0": 70.07, "t1": 77.32, "clip": 70.01, "text": "跑得越快，到达的时间窗口就越窄；哪怕一条路长了一点点，那件货晚到一步，就赶不上，整排数据就拼错了。", "ch": [70.07, 70.508, 70.946, 71.384, 71.822, 72.41, 72.536, 72.663, 72.789, 72.915, 73.042, 73.168, 73.295, 73.421, 73.547, 73.674, 73.95, 74.065, 74.179, 74.294, 74.408, 74.523, 74.637, 74.752, 74.866, 74.981, 75.095, 75.31, 75.384, 75.458, 75.531, 75.605, 75.679, 75.753, 75.826, 76.0, 76.138, 76.276, 76.414, 76.552, 76.78, 76.84, 76.9, 76.96, 77.02, 77.08, 77.14, 77.2, 77.26], "sub": "跑得越快，窗口越窄", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L16–L18"}, {"id": "a17", "t0": 77.77, "t1": 84.66, "clip": 77.7, "text": "所以速度一高，与其让几十条路勉强齐步走，不如只修少数几条路，让货物排成一列，每条路都跑到极快。", "ch": [77.77, 77.917, 78.063, 78.21, 78.356, 78.503, 78.65, 78.796, 78.943, 79.089, 79.236, 79.383, 79.529, 79.676, 79.822, 79.969, 80.116, 80.262, 80.409, 80.555, 80.702, 80.849, 80.995, 81.142, 81.288, 81.435, 81.581, 81.728, 81.875, 82.021, 82.168, 82.314, 82.461, 82.608, 82.754, 82.901, 83.047, 83.194, 83.341, 83.487, 83.634, 83.78, 83.927, 84.074, 84.22, 84.367, 84.513], "sub": "只修几条路，每条跑到极快", "big": null, "seg": "reveal", "src": "L19"}, {"id": "a19", "t0": 85.11, "t1": 85.86, "clip": 85.05, "text": "一句话带走。", "ch": [85.11, 85.235, 85.36, 85.485, 85.61, 85.735], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L46"}, {"id": "a20", "t0": 86.11, "t1": 90.13, "clip": 86.05, "text": "速度一高，并排走就难以对齐，所以数据要排成一列出发。", "ch": [86.11, 86.262, 86.414, 86.566, 86.718, 86.97, 87.122, 87.274, 87.427, 87.579, 87.731, 87.883, 88.036, 88.188, 88.47, 88.608, 88.747, 88.885, 89.023, 89.162, 89.3, 89.438, 89.577, 89.715, 89.853, 89.992], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "L47"}, {"id": "a21", "t0": 90.38, "t1": 94.17, "clip": 90.32, "text": "下一条：排成一列以后，连续五个 1，对方怎么数清？", "ch": [90.38, 90.538, 90.696, 90.854, 91.012, 91.17, 91.328, 91.485, 91.643, 91.801, 91.959, 92.117, 92.252, 92.388, 92.523, 92.659, 92.794, 92.929, 93.065, 93.223, 93.38, 93.538, 93.696, 93.854, 94.012], "sub": null, "big": null, "seg": "end", "src": "新增"}], "shots": [{"kind": "bga", "t0": 0, "paper": false, "first": "a01", "t1": 18.85}, {"kind": "parallel", "t0": 18.85, "paper": false, "first": "a04", "t1": 25.58}, {"kind": "serdes", "t0": 25.58, "paper": false, "first": "a05", "t1": 45.15}, {"kind": "desk", "t0": 45.15, "paper": true, "first": "a10", "strips": [{"id": "W0", "line": "a10", "from": "为什么", "to": "并排走"}, {"id": "R1", "line": "a10", "from": "第一", "to": "不够"}], "t1": 48.29}, {"kind": "pins", "t0": 48.29, "paper": false, "first": "a11", "t1": 55.72}, {"kind": "desk", "t0": 55.72, "paper": true, "first": "a13", "strips": [{"id": "Q1", "line": "a13", "from": "第二", "to": "到达"}], "t1": 58.3}, {"kind": "race", "t0": 58.3, "paper": false, "first": "a14", "t1": 77.47}, {"kind": "serial", "t0": 77.47, "paper": false, "first": "a17", "t1": 84.81}, {"kind": "take", "t0": 84.81, "paper": true, "first": "a19", "strips": [{"id": "E0", "line": "a19", "from": null, "to": null}, {"id": "E1", "line": "a20", "from": "速度", "to": "对齐"}, {"id": "E2", "line": "a20", "from": "所以", "to": "出发"}], "cy": 700, "t1": 95.77}], "hudIn": 18.85}